{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1140.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"4f6f5e363ac979099a549def525159ca498a2d6491b4effea1ca52309e926dad","ja":"今日のお仕事、楽しかったね♪\nまさか、お化け屋敷のお化けをやるなんて。","zh":"今天的工作真开心呢♪\n没想到居然要去鬼屋扮鬼。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1140.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1f6f3cfdc3ef0e323414634b632e31cc96c43764efa1fc222048f5de0bf7e181","ja":"はい！　メイクもバッチリしてもらって、\n本物になっちゃったみたいでした！　……あれっ？","zh":"好！妆容也画得非常完美，\n感觉就像变成了真的一样！……咦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1140.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"391def71d7cbf4a577fe92ce84f7d93823ff96d54abf51db16eddf8033ff7e26","ja":"あの後ろ姿って、響さんですよね！\n響さんもお仕事の帰りなのかな？","zh":"那个背影，是响小姐吧！\n响小姐也是刚工作完回去吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1140.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3282e657d3e6660918c8789329a64acd00eabf1b38fdad29a616effbda2bb136","ja":"……お～い、響さ～んっ！！","zh":"……喂～，响～姐！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1140.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"0004d9d1f7a96c2be4fdec70c9d613612a6d75cff67bc8081b54dc1d38a899c8","ja":"……あれ？　行っちゃった。\n聞こえなかったのかな……？","zh":"……咦？走掉了。\n是没有听到吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1140.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"2b6c6b6836cfa85392f89159bf9a7b92e73af25815ad05d0e05663228768101f","ja":"その翌日……","zh":"第二天……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
