{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1140.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"0290db364c9cb4f2ea1d3092fb9e2ea2c32f874f09f38cdea6d96d4e3d09a15b","ja":"あっ、響さん。昨日、劇場の近くで見かけて\n声をかけたんですけど、気づかなかったですか？","zh":"啊，响。昨天在剧场附近看到你，\n就跟你打了招呼，你没注意到吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1140.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"44b21321b724404b4acfcdafe76aaa947ec3c10cbc0120edfb1f73fa10170bab","ja":"えっ？　昨日、劇場の近くで？","zh":"咦？昨天在剧场附近吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1140.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"42a394a93aefe20d3c40081110df056d2feafc2c3a26b98db30ec7ea0b657347","ja":"うん、夕方くらいかな。可奈ちゃんが結構大きな声で\n呼んだんだけど、そのまま行っちゃったんだ。","zh":"嗯，大概是傍晚的时候吧。可奈叫得挺大声的，\n但她就那么直接走掉了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1140.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"7fd0188e23cfe7c56ee4f39b1331106c01fc18d5366417e44e510892eb8cbc24","ja":"珍しいですね～。\n考え事でもしていたのでしょうか～？","zh":"真少见呢～\n是在想事情吗～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
